# Black Panther's prevention ("Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Black Panther") and Ancient Adamantoise's
# redirection ("All damage that would be dealt to you and other permanents you control is dealt to this creature
# instead") both apply to the 3 damage Bot2's Lightning Bolt would deal to Black Panther: its controller chooses which
# applies first (CR 616.1). Bot1 has the prevention apply first: the damage is prevented, and there is nothing left to
# redirect (CR 615.6). Neither creature is dealt damage, and the prevention is recorded. The other order is
# black-panther-and-ancient-adamantoise-its-controller-redirects-the-bolt-first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
King T'Challa
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.King T'Challa.Cast(Ability: back face)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Black Panther, Hope Enduring)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Replace(prevents)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Panther, Hope Enduring.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise.Damage = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Prevented = 3 Lightning Bolt > Black Panther, Hope Enduring by Black Panther, Hope Enduring
